"This tutorial demonstrates how to find the maximum independent set of a graph using the [Aqarios Constrained Quantum Optimizer](/guides/aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) [\\[1\\]](#references), a constrained combinatorial optimization problem.\n"
"An instance from the QOBLIB [\\[2\\]](#references) benchmark library is formulated as a binary linear program and passed to the Optimizer Application Function.\n"
"The optimizer handles all reformulation, circuit synthesis, transpilation, and iterative warm starting internally (see [\\[3\\]](#references) for details).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng tutorial na ito kung paano hanapin ang maximum independent set ng isang graph gamit ang [Aqarios Constrained Quantum Optimizer](/guides/aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) [\\[1\\]](#references), isang constrained combinatorial optimization problem.\n"
"Ang isang instance mula sa QOBLIB [\\[2\\]](#references) benchmark library ay binubuo bilang binary linear program at ipinapasa sa Optimizer Application Function.\n"
"Ang optimizer ang bahalang humawak sa lahat ng reformulation, circuit synthesis, transpilation, at iterative warm starting sa loob mismo (tingnan ang [\\[3\\]](#references) para sa detalye).\n"

